  "R1_bycol_removes_M": {
   "text": "fp32, gemmc1, the fit T = C/f + M over its launches. PASS: M <= 0.15 us and C in [470, 590]. FAIL: M >= 0.50 us (the desk model's reading of the fixed term is wrong). Between: PARTIAL. No verdict if the launches span less than 60 MHz: then R7 alone reads it.",
